      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm still a bit worried about the asthma part though, since i know beta blockers can sometimes cause breathing issues. but if i just take a tiny bit like 10mg, do you think that's enough to keep my hands steady without messing with my lungs too much? also, is it okay if i take my albuterol inhaler right after if i feel a bit tight? i just really need this to work for tomorrow.",
